      "promptZhHans": "已知函数f(x)的定义域为R，且对任意实数x,y满足f(x+y)=f(x)+f(y)。若f(2)=4，则f(3)的值为（ ）",
      "optionsZhHans": [
        "A. 5",
        "B. 6",
        "C. 7",
        "D. 8"
      ],
      "answer": "B. 6",
      "acceptedAnswers": [
        "B. 6"
      ],
      "explanationZhHans": "令x=y=0得f(0)=0；令y=-x得f(0)=f(x)+f(-x)，故f(-x)=-f(x)。由f(2)=4，令x=y=1得f(2)=2f(1)=4，所以f(1)=2。于是f(3)=f(2+1)=f(2)+f(1)=4+2=6。",
